## Approved diagnosis
With Core 7cbf12de41 the target's monitor lease keeps processing, so the framework hello DATA reaches the test's raw DEALER
promptly and sits at the count-1 FIFO head; the fixture only calls `await_native_reply()` (`:5241`, helper `:81-85`) and never
receives that DATA, so the native reply behind it is never delivered and the request ends REQUEST_TIMED_OUT (5 s). Class B
(test fixture). Simplest fix: the fixture receives (and discards or asserts) the hello DATA on the DEALER before awaiting the
native reply — no runtime change, no timeout change.

## What to do
